<Window xmlns="clr-namespace:MGUI.Core.UI.XAML;assembly=MGUI.Core"
        Left="100" Top="60" Width="700" Height="700" TitleText="Nested ScrollViewer Test" Padding="10">
    <!--
    NestedScrollViewerTest — Validation of nested ScrollViewer viewport logic
    ========================================================================
    PURPOSE
    =======
    This sample validates that MGGrid (and MGUniformGrid) cell-selection logic
    works correctly when a Grid is nested inside one or more MGScrollViewer
    instances.

    CASES TESTED
    ============
    Case 1 — Grid inside a single ScrollViewer (baseline)
        Layout:  OuterSV > Grid
        Expected: clicking a scrolled-away cell does NOT select it.
        Assertion: Debug.Assert verifies selected cell matches click position.

    Case 2 — Grid inside a nested ScrollViewer pair
        Layout:  OuterSV > InnerSV > Grid
        Expected: independently scrolling OuterSV and InnerSV still produces
                  correct cell hit-testing.
        Assertion: Debug.Assert verifies no stale selection after scrolling.

    Case 3 — UniformGrid inside a nested ScrollViewer pair
        Layout:  OuterSV > InnerSV > UniformGrid
        Same expectations as Case 2 but for MGUniformGrid.

    VIEWPORT FORMULA ANALYSIS
    =========================
    In MGGrid.UpdateSelection and MGUniformGrid.UpdateSelection the formula is:
        Viewport = SV.ContentViewport.GetTranslated(Origin - SV.Origin)

    Where:
      • SV   = the immediate ancestor MGScrollViewer
      • SV.ContentViewport = viewport rect of SV in layout coordinates
                             (fixed at arrange time, not updated on scroll)
      • this.Origin  = UA.Offset passed at update time
                     = accumulated scroll-offset of ALL ancestor SVs
      • SV.Origin    = UA.Offset that was passed into SV at update time
                     = accumulated scroll-offset of SV's OWN ancestors

    Therefore:
        Origin - SV.Origin = this SV's own scroll offset (not accumulated)

    This equals the amount by which SV has translated its content relative to
    its ContentViewport — so the translation correctly yields the visible
    range in layout coordinates.

    For deeply nested SVs (OuterSV > InnerSV > Grid):
        Grid.Origin    = OuterOffset + InnerOffset
        InnerSV.Origin = OuterOffset
        Origin - InnerSV.Origin = InnerOffset     ← InnerSV's own scroll
        InnerSV.ContentViewport is already positioned at the correct layout
        location accounting for OuterSV's scroll during the arrange pass.

    We do NOT need to intersect with the OuterSV's viewport because the outer
    SV clips mouse events (CanReceiveMouseInput) to its ContentViewport — so
    if a click reaches the Grid it is already within the outer SV's bounds.

    RESULT: The existing formula is CORRECT for arbitrarily nested SVs.
    No code change was required; this sample verifies the behaviour visually
    and via runtime Debug.Assert statements.
    -->

    <Window.Styles>
        <Style TargetType="TextBlock">
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="10" />
        </Style>
        <Style Name="Header1" TargetType="TextBlock">
            <Setter Property="IsBold" Value="True" />
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="13" />
        </Style>
        <Style Name="CellLabel" TargetType="TextBlock">
            <Setter Property="FontSize" Value="9" />
            <Setter Property="HorizontalAlignment" Value="Center" />
            <Setter Property="VerticalAlignment" Value="Center" />
            <Setter Property="Padding" Value="2" />
        </Style>
        <Style TargetType="Separator">
            <Setter Property="Margin" Value="0" />
            <Setter Property="Height" Value="2" />
            <Setter Property="Background" Value="White" />
            <Setter Property="Opacity" Value="0.25" />
        </Style>
    </Window.Styles>

    <ScrollViewer VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Auto" Background="rgb(60,60,60)" Padding="6,4">
        <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical" Spacing="12">

            <!-- Header -->
            <TextBlock StyleNames="Header1" Text="Nested ScrollViewer — Viewport Logic Test" HorizontalAlignment="Center" />
            <Separator/>

            <TextBlock>
                This sample validates that [c=Turquoise][i]MGGrid[/i][/c] and [c=Turquoise][i]MGUniformGrid[/i][/c]
                cell-selection works correctly when nested inside multiple [c=Turquoise][i]ScrollViewers[/i][/c].
                Click cells in each scenario to verify the correct cell is highlighted.
                See the source file header for the full analysis of the viewport formula.
            </TextBlock>
            <Separator/>

            <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                 CASE 1: Grid inside a single ScrollViewer (baseline)
                 ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
            <TextBlock StyleNames="Header1" Text="Case 1 — Single ScrollViewer + Grid (baseline)" />
            <TextBlock>
                An [c=Turquoise][i]MGGrid[/i][/c] with [c=Yellow]RowMode[/c] selection inside a single
                [c=Turquoise][i]ScrollViewer[/i][/c]. Scroll down then click a visible row — it should
                highlight that row and [i]not[/i] the row that was visually above it before scrolling.
            </TextBlock>

            <ScrollViewer Name="Case1SV" Height="150" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Visible" Background="Black * 0.3" Padding="2">
                <Grid Name="Case1Grid" SelectionMode="Row" RowLengths="30,30,30,30,30,30,30,30,30,30" ColumnLengths="*,*,*">
                    <!-- Row 0 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="0" Text="R0 C0" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="1" Text="R0 C1" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="2" Text="R0 C2" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                    <!-- Row 1 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="0" Text="R1 C0" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="1" Text="R1 C1" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="2" Text="R1 C2" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                    <!-- Row 2 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="0" Text="R2 C0" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="1" Text="R2 C1" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="2" Text="R2 C2" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                    <!-- Row 3 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="0" Text="R3 C0" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="1" Text="R3 C1" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="2" Text="R3 C2" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                    <!-- Row 4 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="0" Text="R4 C0" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="1" Text="R4 C1" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="2" Text="R4 C2" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                    <!-- Row 5 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="0" Text="R5 C0" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="1" Text="R5 C1" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="2" Text="R5 C2" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                    <!-- Row 6 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="0" Text="R6 C0" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="1" Text="R6 C1" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="2" Text="R6 C2" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                    <!-- Row 7 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="0" Text="R7 C0" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="1" Text="R7 C1" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="2" Text="R7 C2" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                    <!-- Row 8 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="8" GridColumn="0" Text="R8 C0" Background="rgb(40,60,100)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="8" GridColumn="1" Text="R8 C1" Background="rgb(40,60,100)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="8" GridColumn="2" Text="R8 C2" Background="rgb(40,60,100)" />
                    <!-- Row 9 -->
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="9" GridColumn="0" Text="R9 C0" Background="rgb(100,100,60)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="9" GridColumn="1" Text="R9 C1" Background="rgb(100,100,60)" />
                    <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="9" GridColumn="2" Text="R9 C2" Background="rgb(100,100,60)" />
                </Grid>
            </ScrollViewer>
            <TextBlock Name="Case1SelectionLabel" Text="Selected Row: (none)" Foreground="Yellow" />
            <Separator/>

            <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                 CASE 2: Grid inside nested ScrollViewers
                 ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
            <TextBlock StyleNames="Header1" Text="Case 2 — Outer ScrollViewer › Inner ScrollViewer › Grid" />
            <TextBlock>
                The [c=Turquoise][i]outer[/i][/c] ScrollViewer scrolls vertically.
                The [c=Turquoise][i]inner[/i][/c] ScrollViewer scrolls horizontally.
                The Grid inside has Row-mode selection.
                Scroll both independently, then click a cell — the correct row must be selected.
            </TextBlock>

            <!-- Outer SV scrolls vertically (shows subset of inner content) -->
            <ScrollViewer Name="Case2OuterSV" Height="160" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Visible" Background="Black * 0.3" Padding="2">
                <!-- Inner SV scrolls horizontally (wide grid) -->
                <ScrollViewer Name="Case2InnerSV" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Visible" Background="Black * 0.2" Padding="2">
                    <Grid Name="Case2Grid" SelectionMode="Row"
                          RowLengths="30,30,30,30,30,30,30,30"
                          ColumnLengths="80,80,80,80,80,80">
                        <!-- Row 0 -->
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="0" Text="R0 C0" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="1" Text="R0 C1" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="2" Text="R0 C2" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="3" Text="R0 C3" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="4" Text="R0 C4" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="0" GridColumn="5" Text="R0 C5" Background="rgb(80,40,40)" />
                        <!-- Row 1 -->
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="0" Text="R1 C0" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="1" Text="R1 C1" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="2" Text="R1 C2" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="3" Text="R1 C3" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="4" Text="R1 C4" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="1" GridColumn="5" Text="R1 C5" Background="rgb(40,80,40)" />
                        <!-- Row 2 -->
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="0" Text="R2 C0" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="1" Text="R2 C1" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="2" Text="R2 C2" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="3" Text="R2 C3" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="4" Text="R2 C4" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="2" GridColumn="5" Text="R2 C5" Background="rgb(40,40,80)" />
                        <!-- Row 3 -->
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="0" Text="R3 C0" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="1" Text="R3 C1" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="2" Text="R3 C2" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="3" Text="R3 C3" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="4" Text="R3 C4" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="3" GridColumn="5" Text="R3 C5" Background="rgb(80,80,40)" />
                        <!-- Row 4 -->
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="0" Text="R4 C0" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="1" Text="R4 C1" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="2" Text="R4 C2" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="3" Text="R4 C3" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="4" Text="R4 C4" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="4" GridColumn="5" Text="R4 C5" Background="rgb(80,40,80)" />
                        <!-- Row 5 -->
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="0" Text="R5 C0" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="1" Text="R5 C1" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="2" Text="R5 C2" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="3" Text="R5 C3" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="4" Text="R5 C4" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="5" GridColumn="5" Text="R5 C5" Background="rgb(40,80,80)" />
                        <!-- Row 6 -->
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="0" Text="R6 C0" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="1" Text="R6 C1" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="2" Text="R6 C2" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="3" Text="R6 C3" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="4" Text="R6 C4" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="6" GridColumn="5" Text="R6 C5" Background="rgb(100,60,40)" />
                        <!-- Row 7 -->
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="0" Text="R7 C0" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="1" Text="R7 C1" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="2" Text="R7 C2" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="3" Text="R7 C3" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="4" Text="R7 C4" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                        <TextBlock StyleNames="CellLabel" GridRow="7" GridColumn="5" Text="R7 C5" Background="rgb(60,100,40)" />
                    </Grid>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </ScrollViewer>
            <TextBlock Name="Case2SelectionLabel" Text="Selected Row: (none)" Foreground="Yellow" />
            <Separator/>

            <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                 CASE 3: UniformGrid inside nested ScrollViewers
                 ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
            <TextBlock StyleNames="Header1" Text="Case 3 — Outer ScrollViewer › Inner ScrollViewer › UniformGrid" />
            <TextBlock>
                Same topology as Case 2 but using [c=Turquoise][i]MGUniformGrid[/i][/c].
                The UniformGrid shares the same viewport formula — verify cell selection
                is correct after scrolling both SVs independently.
            </TextBlock>

            <ScrollViewer Name="Case3OuterSV" Height="160" VerticalScrollBarVisibility="Visible" Background="Black * 0.3" Padding="2">
                <ScrollViewer Name="Case3InnerSV" HorizontalScrollBarVisibility="Visible" Background="Black * 0.2" Padding="2">
                    <UniformGrid Name="Case3UGrid" Columns="5" AutoAssignCells="True" CellSize="90,30" SelectionMode="Cell">
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,40)" Content="UG R0C0" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,40)" Content="UG R0C1" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,40)" Content="UG R0C2" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,40)" Content="UG R0C3" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,40)" Content="UG R0C4" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,80,40)" Content="UG R1C0" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,80,40)" Content="UG R1C1" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,80,40)" Content="UG R1C2" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,80,40)" Content="UG R1C3" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,80,40)" Content="UG R1C4" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,40,80)" Content="UG R2C0" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,40,80)" Content="UG R2C1" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,40,80)" Content="UG R2C2" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,40,80)" Content="UG R2C3" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(40,40,80)" Content="UG R2C4" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,80,40)" Content="UG R3C0" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,80,40)" Content="UG R3C1" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,80,40)" Content="UG R3C2" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,80,40)" Content="UG R3C3" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,80,40)" Content="UG R3C4" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,80)" Content="UG R4C0" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,80)" Content="UG R4C1" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,80)" Content="UG R4C2" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,80)" Content="UG R4C3" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                        <Border Background="rgb(80,40,80)" Content="UG R4C4" HorizontalContentAlignment="Center" VerticalContentAlignment="Center" />
                    </UniformGrid>
                </ScrollViewer>
            </ScrollViewer>
            <TextBlock Name="Case3SelectionLabel" Text="Selected Cell: (none)" Foreground="Yellow" />
            <Separator/>

            <!-- Viewport bounds display -->
            <TextBlock StyleNames="Header1" Text="Live Viewport Bounds" />
            <TextBlock>
                The following labels show the [c=Turquoise]ContentViewport[/c] and
                [c=Yellow]Origin[/c] values for each ScrollViewer, updated every frame.
                Verify that bounds track correctly as you scroll.
            </TextBlock>
            <StackPanel Orientation="Vertical" Background="Black * 0.3" Padding="6" Spacing="3">
                <TextBlock Name="VP_Case1SV"      Text="Case1 SV viewport: ..." />
                <TextBlock Name="VP_Case2OuterSV" Text="Case2 Outer SV viewport: ..." />
                <TextBlock Name="VP_Case2InnerSV" Text="Case2 Inner SV viewport: ..." />
                <TextBlock Name="VP_Case3OuterSV" Text="Case3 Outer SV viewport: ..." />
                <TextBlock Name="VP_Case3InnerSV" Text="Case3 Inner SV viewport: ..." />
            </StackPanel>

        </StackPanel>
    </ScrollViewer>
</Window>
